00:43:15,552 --> 00:43:19,263
The shell went off right beside him.
Camera on his shoulder saved his life.

489
00:43:19,347 --> 00:43:20,806
You hear that, Max?

490
00:43:20,891 --> 00:43:23,684
Your stupid camera
saved your stupid life.

491
00:43:24,352 --> 00:43:26,187
Where were you?

492
00:43:26,688 --> 00:43:29,398
Out there in the Pine Barrens.

493
00:43:29,483 --> 00:43:31,442
We were attached to
a National Guard unit.

494
00:43:31,526 --> 00:43:33,110
The 83rd Mechanised.

495
00:43:33,195 --> 00:43:35,488
They moved on one of those things
around midnight.

496
00:43:35,572 --> 00:43:37,281
They've got some kind of shield
around them.

497
00:43:37,365 --> 00:43:40,117
You can't see it, but everything
we fire at them detonates too early,

498
00:43:40,202 --> 00:43:43,454
before we can get close enough
to cause any damage.

499
00:43:43,538 --> 00:43:47,333
When they flash that thing,
everything lights up like Hiroshima.

500
00:43:48,001 --> 00:43:50,211
There's more than one?

501
00:43:51,296 --> 00:43:52,963
You got to be kidding me, right?

502
00:43:54,424 --> 00:43:56,634
We were feeding New York,
but New York went dark.

503
00:43:56,718 --> 00:43:59,178
So we patched over to DC,
they went down.

504
00:43:59,262 --> 00:44:02,097
LA, Chicago, uplinked to London.

505
00:44:02,182 --> 00:44:05,434
Even called the affiliates
to try to get them to catch the feed,

506
00:44:05,519 --> 00:44:08,354
but nobody answers.
It's the same everywhere.

507
00:44:08,438 --> 00:44:12,358
Once the Tripods start to move,
no more news comes out of that area.

508
00:44:23,411 --> 00:44:25,162
My God.

509
00:44:26,248 --> 00:44:28,207
You ain't seen nothing yet.

510
00:44:31,044 --> 00:44:34,338
I saw that storm.
I was right in the middle of one of those.

511
00:44:34,422 --> 00:44:36,131
Well, you didn't see it like this.

512
00:44:36,216 --> 00:44:38,676
Those machines come up
from under the ground, right?

513
00:44:38,760 --> 00:44:41,762
So that means they must've been
buried here a long time ago.

514
00:44:41,846 --> 00:44:46,058
So who's driving the goddamn things?
Watch the lightning.

515
00:44:46,142 --> 00:44:47,851
Watch it.

516
00:44:49,271 --> 00:44:50,729
Watch the lightning.

517
00:44:50,814 --> 00:44:53,065
Keep watching the lightning.

518
00:44:56,778 --> 00:44:58,779
What is that?

519
00:44:58,947 --> 00:45:03,200
That is them.
They come down in capsules,

520
00:45:03,285 --> 00:45:06,245
riding the lightning into the ground,
into the machines, right?

521
00:45:09,207 --> 00:45:11,208
You hear that?

522
00:45:11,293 --> 00:45:13,711
We're getting the hell out of here.

523
00:45:17,132 --> 00:45:18,882
Get in, get in, get in, get in.

524
00:45:20,468 --> 00:45:23,554
Hey, were you on that plane?

525
00:45:25,599 --> 00:45:28,934
That's too bad.
It would've been a really great story.

526
00:45:30,645 --> 00:45:32,813
Look at me. Look at me.

527
00:45:32,981 --> 00:45:35,232
You keep your eyes only on me,
understand?

528
00:45:35,317 --> 00:45:37,276
- Okay.
- Don't look down. Don't look around me.

529
00:45:37,986 --> 00:45:41,113
I'm taking you to the car.
You're gonna want to look around.

530
00:45:41,197 --> 00:45:42,906
But you're not going to.

531
00:45:42,991 --> 00:45:44,533
- Are you?
- No.

532
00:45:44,826 --> 00:45:48,329
You're doing good. You're doing good.
Keep your eyes on me.

533
00:45:48,413 --> 00:45:49,705
I'm going right to Boston.

534
00:45:49,789 --> 00:45:52,124
- We're gonna see your mom.
- I'm not gonna look, Dad.

535
00:45:52,208 --> 00:45:54,293
That's a girl. That's my girl. Now listen.

536
00:45:54,377 --> 00:45:56,211
- I want you to close your eyes, okay?
- Okay.

537
00:45:56,296 --> 00:45:58,756
Got them closed? There you go.

538
00:45:58,840 --> 00:46:01,175
- Keep them closed for me.
- Okay.

539
00:46:06,473 --> 00:46:08,015
Robbie, get in.

540
00:46:09,726 --> 00:46:11,518
- Robbie, get in!
- Why are you yelling?

541
00:46:11,603 --> 00:46:13,103
It's okay.

542
00:46:15,690 --> 00:46:17,191
Get in.

543
00:46:37,671 --> 00:46:40,172
