who might want our car.

563
00:47:38,231 --> 00:47:40,983
- There's nobody around.
- Yeah. I got to go.

564
00:47:48,658 --> 00:47:51,493
All right. Rachel?
Rachel, it's good right there.

565
00:47:51,578 --> 00:47:53,871
I'm not going in front of you guys.

566
00:47:53,955 --> 00:47:56,373
All right,
then just go where I can see you.

567
00:47:56,458 --> 00:47:57,958
Are you crazy?

568
00:47:58,042 --> 00:48:00,043
- Don't look!
- Well, I'm not gonna look.

569
00:48:00,128 --> 00:48:02,963
- Just stay in sight!
- That's looking!

570
00:48:04,382 --> 00:48:07,259
Okay, well, listen, every time
you guys don't listen to me,

571
00:48:07,343 --> 00:48:10,637
I'm telling your mother, okay?
I'm making a list.

572
00:48:12,140 --> 00:48:13,849
Making a list.

573
00:48:56,142 --> 00:48:59,603
- I told you to stay where I could see you.
- Sorry. I'm sorry.

574
00:49:14,369 --> 00:49:15,953
Stop! Don't go!

575
00:49:16,037 --> 00:49:18,288
Wait! Stop! Let me on!

576
00:49:18,373 --> 00:49:20,707
Let me on! Give me a hand!

577
00:49:20,792 --> 00:49:22,376
Wait! Stop!

578
00:49:22,502 --> 00:49:24,294
- Stop! Give me a hand!
- Hey, watch it, kid,

579
00:49:24,379 --> 00:49:25,420
you're gonna get yourself run over!

580
00:49:25,505 --> 00:49:28,465
- Give me a hand! You have room!
- Robbie!

581
00:49:28,550 --> 00:49:31,552
- Robbie, you wanna go in that direction?
- Stop! Stop! Wait!

582
00:49:31,636 --> 00:49:34,429
There's nothing living
in that direction, Robbie.

583
00:49:34,514 --> 00:49:36,890
What do you care?
You never gave a shit before.

584
00:49:36,975 --> 00:49:39,226
- You never gave a shit!
- Okay, hard-ass,

585
00:49:39,310 --> 00:49:41,603
what's your plan, huh?
You're in charge now!

586
00:49:41,688 --> 00:49:43,188
You tell me what we're doing.
What do we do?

587
00:49:43,273 --> 00:49:45,649
We catch up with these soldiers!
Hook up with whoever else isn't dead,

588
00:49:45,733 --> 00:49:47,192
and we get back at them.

589
00:49:47,277 --> 00:49:50,737
We get back at them.
That's what we do.

590
00:49:50,822 --> 00:49:55,158
Now let's try one that doesn't involve
your 10-year-old sister joining the Army.

591
00:49:55,243 --> 00:49:57,494
- You have anything like that?
- Why don't you just tell us the truth?

592
00:49:57,579 --> 00:49:59,746
- Wanna try something like that?
- You have no idea which way to go.

593
00:49:59,831 --> 00:50:02,374
- You have anything like that?
- You wanna come off all wise and shit!

594
00:50:02,458 --> 00:50:05,168
You only chose Boston
because you hoped Mom was there.

595
00:50:05,253 --> 00:50:07,671
And if she's there,
you can dump us on her.

596
00:50:07,755 --> 00:50:11,425
You can dump us on her, and then
you'll only have to care about yourself,

597
00:50:11,509 --> 00:50:14,511
which is exactly the way you like it.

598
00:50:16,055 --> 00:50:19,850
Robbie! Where are you trying to go?

599
00:50:19,934 --> 00:50:22,394
What are you trying to do?

600
00:50:23,354 --> 00:50:26,398
Who's gonna take care of me if you go?

601
00:50:44,459 --> 00:50:47,461
<i>This is a test of
the Emergency Alert System.</i>

602
00:50:47,795 --> 00:50:50,505
