604
00:50:54,677 --> 00:50:57,679
<i>This concludes the test
of the Emergency Alert...</i>

605
00:50:59,265 --> 00:51:02,392
I'll close my eyes.
Why don't you drive for a bit?

606
00:51:03,061 --> 00:51:05,145
I don't have a licence.

607
00:51:06,230 --> 00:51:08,607
Since when has that stopped you?

608
00:51:39,222 --> 00:51:40,973
Ray.

609
00:51:42,976 --> 00:51:45,310
Ray! Dad!

610
00:51:48,940 --> 00:51:50,482
You think you could...

611
00:51:50,566 --> 00:51:53,276
You think you could...
Do you think you could...

612
00:51:54,028 --> 00:51:55,529
Don't stop.

613
00:51:55,613 --> 00:51:57,781
Don't take your foot off. Okay?

614
00:51:57,865 --> 00:52:00,951
I got it, but keep your foot on.
Okay, I got it. I got it.

615
00:52:01,035 --> 00:52:03,912
- Where is everybody going?
- I don't know, Rach.

616
00:52:03,997 --> 00:52:06,123
But we do, right?

617
00:52:06,207 --> 00:52:08,125
Yeah, we do.

618
00:52:19,887 --> 00:52:21,555
Why did he do that?

619
00:52:23,725 --> 00:52:25,809
- Why is he doing that?
- He wants a ride, Rach.

620
00:52:25,893 --> 00:52:29,146
- Everybody just wants a ride.
- Can we give him one?

621
00:52:29,230 --> 00:52:32,858
Sit back and put on your seat belt.
Robbie, put on your seat belt.

622
00:52:32,942 --> 00:52:34,901
Put on your seat belt, Rachel.

623
00:52:38,072 --> 00:52:40,073
- Be careful.
- How'd you fix this?

624
00:52:40,158 --> 00:52:42,409
- How'd you fix the car?
- Please!

625
00:52:45,580 --> 00:52:47,497
I'm sorry, I can't. I can't.

626
00:52:47,582 --> 00:52:49,458
Please, get away from the car.

627
00:52:49,542 --> 00:52:51,418
Hey! Stop the car.

628
00:52:51,502 --> 00:52:54,254
- Stop the car!
- Get off the car!

629
00:52:55,131 --> 00:52:57,382
You could carry 20 people in there!

630
00:52:57,467 --> 00:52:59,843
- Stop the car!
- Get off the car!

631
00:52:59,927 --> 00:53:01,595
Stop the car!

632
00:53:05,558 --> 00:53:07,184
Hold on.

633
00:53:07,268 --> 00:53:08,852
- Wait, wait.
- Look out. Look out.

634
00:53:08,936 --> 00:53:10,520
Look out! Hold on!

635
00:53:19,405 --> 00:53:20,655
Are you okay?

636
00:53:30,625 --> 00:53:31,792
Stop!

637
00:53:31,876 --> 00:53:33,293
- Ray!
- Robbie!

638
00:53:34,087 --> 00:53:35,629
No, wait! Wait!

639
00:53:35,713 --> 00:53:38,715
No! No, just wait! Okay! Wait! Stop!

640
00:53:38,800 --> 00:53:40,801
