- Daddy!

641
00:53:40,885 --> 00:53:42,427
Rachel!

642
00:53:43,054 --> 00:53:44,805
Get out of there!

643
00:53:46,140 --> 00:53:47,974
Robbie!

644
00:53:55,149 --> 00:53:57,275
Daddy!

645
00:53:57,360 --> 00:53:59,820
- Ray!
- Get in the car!

646
00:54:04,826 --> 00:54:07,619
- Help!
- Rachel! Get out of the car!

647
00:54:07,703 --> 00:54:09,830
Rachel, get... Get out of the car.

648
00:54:09,914 --> 00:54:12,082
