- Daddy!

649
00:54:19,799 --> 00:54:21,925
- Take it easy!
- Get off the car! Get off the car!

650
00:54:22,009 --> 00:54:27,097
Get off! Get off the car. Move! Move!

651
00:54:27,181 --> 00:54:28,181
Where's my son?

652
00:54:28,266 --> 00:54:29,266
You don't need that, man.
