654
00:54:31,894 --> 00:54:33,186
- Put the gun down, man.
- Robbie!

655
00:54:33,271 --> 00:54:34,855
Put it down.

656
00:54:39,902 --> 00:54:41,528
Dad!

657
00:54:43,364 --> 00:54:45,115
Okay, man, now, listen.

658
00:54:45,283 --> 00:54:48,326
- Put down the gun. I'm taking the car.
