659
00:54:48,411 --> 00:54:50,537
- Put down the gun. I'm taking the car.
- Please. All I want...

660
00:54:50,621 --> 00:54:53,290
- Put down the goddamn gun!
- All I want is my daughter.

661
00:54:53,374 --> 00:54:55,917
- I'm taking the car, man.
- Please, I just want my daughter.

662
00:54:56,002 --> 00:54:57,961
Please, let me...
Let me just take my daughter. Can I...

663
00:54:58,045 --> 00:54:59,588
- All I want is my daughter.
- Yeah, yeah, yeah.

664
00:54:59,672 --> 00:55:00,922
- Go ahead, man. Take her.
- Take my daughter?

665
00:55:01,007 --> 00:55:01,965
Take her. Yeah. Yeah.

666
00:55:02,049 --> 00:55:03,675
Robbie.

667
00:55:13,102 --> 00:55:14,895
Take me with you.

668
00:56:16,499 --> 00:56:18,541
Have you seen this girl?
This is my daughter.

669
00:56:18,626 --> 00:56:21,378
He needs his medicine.

670
00:56:32,306 --> 00:56:34,224
We've got it the worst,
that's what I heard.

671
00:56:34,308 --> 00:56:37,394
The US, mostly.
South America and Asia, some.

672
00:56:37,478 --> 00:56:39,187
There's nothing going on in Europe.

673
00:56:39,272 --> 00:56:41,982
Europe got the worst of it,
that's what everybody's saying.

674
00:56:42,066 --> 00:56:44,567
- Completely wiped out some of it.
- I don't give a shit who it is.

675
00:56:44,652 --> 00:56:47,112
I got up close to one of those things
in Stanfordville.

676
00:56:47,196 --> 00:56:49,072
If they're all over the place, we're dead.

677
00:56:49,156 --> 00:56:52,033
- Looks like the power's still on here.
- Yeah.

678
00:56:52,118 --> 00:56:54,160
Yeah, power's still on.

679
00:56:54,328 --> 00:56:57,247
Because nothing bad's come up
from the ground.

680
00:56:57,331 --> 00:57:00,667
- Hold on. Hold on, move back.
- Watch out there, lady.

681
00:57:01,168 --> 00:57:03,169
I said, move back.

682
00:57:39,623 --> 00:57:43,918
<i>Unless you are O-positive
and Rh-negative, thank you very much,</i>

683
00:57:44,003 --> 00:57:47,005
<i>but we already have
more blood than we can use.</i>

684
00:57:47,089 --> 00:57:50,592
<i>Again, if you are O-positive,</i>

685
00:57:50,676 --> 00:57:54,220
<i>Rh-negative, identify yourselves.</i>

686
00:57:54,305 --> 00:57:56,431
<i>If you are not, thank you very much.</i>

687
00:57:56,515 --> 00:57:59,559
<i>We already have more blood
than we can use for the transfusions.</i>

688
00:57:59,643 --> 00:58:01,728
Let's go, folks.

689
00:58:01,812 --> 00:58:04,731
This way. This way. Keep it moving.

690
00:58:04,815 --> 00:58:09,027
Keep it moving. This way.
Let's go, folks. Keep it moving.

691
00:58:09,111 --> 00:58:13,365
Please move forward calmly.
The boat can make more than one trip.

692
00:58:13,449 --> 00:58:17,744
Please move forward calmly.
Take your time. Don't rush.

693
00:58:17,828 --> 00:58:20,121
Ray! Ray! Ray!

694
00:58:20,206 --> 00:58:22,665
