00:58:59,954 --> 00:59:02,914
But don't worry,
there'll be plenty of room for everybody.

704
00:59:03,499 --> 00:59:06,459
- We got sick people here. Let us on.
- Let us on, for Christ's sake.

705
00:59:40,327 --> 00:59:44,205
Cast off. Get that ramp up.

706
00:59:44,290 --> 00:59:47,417
Cast off now. Get that ramp up.

707
00:59:47,501 --> 00:59:48,751
Cast off.

708
00:59:48,836 --> 00:59:51,796
No more people. No more people.
