719
01:00:41,096 --> 01:00:42,222
- Everybody, wait.
- Hold on.

720
01:00:42,306 --> 01:00:43,681
- You just stay with me.
- Okay.

721
01:00:43,766 --> 01:00:45,099
Grab my jacket.

722
01:00:45,184 --> 01:00:46,768
Everybody, back up.

723
01:00:46,852 --> 01:00:47,977
Back up.

